{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"prelim-2005-common-biology-12","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2005,"subject":"biology","number":12,"points":null,"unitId":"signaling","unitLabel":"세포 신호전달","topic":"신호전달","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["signaling","metabolism","endocrine","cell"],"stem":"그림은간조직의세포에작용하는아드레날린신호전달계의\n모식도이다.\n위신호전달계에대한설명으로옳은것을<보기>에서모두\n고른것은?\n<보기>\nㄱ. ATP는아드레날린의신호를전달하는세포내의신호\n분자이다.\nㄴ. AMP는불활성효소1의활성화를억제하는신호분자\n이다.\nㄷ. 효소의단계적연쇄반응을거치는것은신호를증폭하는\n방법이된다.\nㄹ. 글리코겐의분해로만들어진포도당은혈당을높이는데\n이용된다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t014"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t015"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t016"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄴ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t017"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t018"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":527,"height":432,"region":0,"bbox":[58.511,48.339,210.8,172.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/prelim-2005-common-biology-12/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":744,"height":407,"region":0,"bbox":[14.111,283.539,297.6,162.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012","t013"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/prelim-2005-common-biology-12/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":3,"sourceRect":[373.089,467.261,690.55,962.626],"width":317.462,"height":495.365,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[58.511,48.339,210.8,172.8],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[14.111,283.539,297.6,162.8],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"text","text":"12. 그림은간조직의세포에작용하는아드레날린신호전달계의","bbox":[5.0,5.0,307.389,11.032],"spans":[{"text":"12.","bbox":[5.0,5.0,12.99,11.032],"origin":[5.0,13.826],"size":10.753,